Z||000000||Mattyman||09-18-2001||05:18 PM||||What are some good, but cheap mods that i can do to my fiero.  I have an 87 coupe and i dont want to rice it out, just make it look better. Thanks||||reg||5
Z||000001||sqoach||09-18-2001||06:22 PM||||Whatever you want! There are all kinds of mods for the fiero. I think the 87/88 coupes look good with a spoiler. You could get a different set of wheels. Lower it a bit (something every fiero needs done). A lot of people have side scoops. You could go all out and get a body kit. Lots of stuff. Your wallet is your limit!<P>------------------<BR>-Adam<BR><FONT COLOR="BLUE">sqoach@yahoo.com</FONT><BR>          <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sqoach.gif">     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/halfpole.gif">          <BR>^^^^^^<B>new project</B>^^^^^^<BR><LI><FONT SIZE="1">84 SE (FOR SALE)*SOLD(?)*<BR><LI>85 Coupe (parts car)($50)*sale pending*<BR><LI>86 SC</FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000002||DaRkLoRD||09-18-2001||07:34 PM||||decklid scoop.. it's a useful mod to assist with cooling, and looks pretty sweet.. spoiler, (maybe a non-fiero one..) other wheels.. lower the car.. window tint.. custom taillight mod.. faux carbon fiber dash/console (www.fieroproject.com/dxr)<BR>etc<P>lots of stuff to do!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>    <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>    <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||3
Z||000003||Urchin||09-18-2001||07:48 PM||||Personally I love the style of the '87 and '88 coupes.  All I would do is put some nice rims on it, lower it, and paint if necessary.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/final.jpg"> <BR>If you can read this, I'm parked.||||reg||1
