Z||000007||qwikgta||09-18-2001||09:29 PM||||I have made many mods to my 88 coupe.  Header, supertrapp, wing, rear swaybar, GTZ 16" rims, short shifter, hood vents, mustang rear scoop (soon), open element air cleaner, clear tail lights, roof painted black, and I have a few more to go. <BR> <BR>Visit my web page (signature) to see pics and info.  (the page is just a start, more soon)<P>Rob<P>------------------<BR>qwikgta@yahoo.com<BR>88 T-Top coupe, 65K, Header no Cat, 16" GTZ rims, short shifter, swaybar, open element air cleaner, hood vents.<BR>http://www.homestead.com/robsfieroproject   <BR>http://www.vafieros.com<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigpic2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
